{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01Ev2tLuy5whPtZunLHAmNF9", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/tag/%e0%b8%9e%e0%b8%b1%e0%b8%94%e0%b8%9e%e0%b8%a3%e0%b8%b0%e0%b8%9e%e0%b8%b4%e0%b8%98%e0%b8%b5%e0%b8%98%e0%b8%a3%e0%b8%a3%e0%b8%a1\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wawards.org/thailand/king-chulalongkorn-s-court-medal.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wawards.org/ru/thailand/king-chulalongkorn-s-court-medal.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thaipbs.or.th/program/WanmaiVariety/episodes/97956\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/tag/%e0%b8%9e%e0%b8%b1%e0%b8%94%e0%b9%80%e0%b8%9b%e0%b8%a3%e0%b8%b5%e0%b8%a2%e0%b8%8d\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thaipost.net/main/detail/55816\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thansettakij.com/blogs/columnist/517955\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wawards.org/ru/thailand/king-chulalongkorn-s-royal-cypher-medal.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digital.car.chula.ac.th/chulaetd/16577\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:03:14.902Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "พัดหน้านางพื้นแพรปักไหมทอง ลักษณะเหมือนพัดเปรียญ รัชกาลที่ 5 สีต่างๆ", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01LBUb31vwxBQvGZjj7HZCLx", "content": [{"title": "www.silpa-mag.com", "url": "https://www.silpa-mag.com/tag/%e0%b8%9e%e0%b8%b1%e0%b8%94%e0%b8%9e%e0%b8%a3%e0%b8%b0%e0%b8%9e%e0%b8%b4%e0%b8%98%e0%b8%b5%e0%b8%98%e0%b8%a3%e0%b8%a3%e0%b8%a1"}, {"title": "King Chulalongkorn's Court Medal", "url": "https://wawards.org/thailand/king-chulalongkorn-s-court-medal.html"}, {"title": "King Chulalongkorn's Court Medal", "url": "https://wawards.org/ru/thailand/king-chulalongkorn-s-court-medal.html"}, {"title": "ยลความงดงามพระราชวังบนเกาะแห่งเดียวของไทยในรัชกาลที่ 5 | วันใหม่วาไรตี้ | 23 ต.ค. 66", "url": "https://www.thaipbs.or.th/program/WanmaiVariety/episodes/97956"}, {"title": "www.silpa-mag.com", "url": "https://www.silpa-mag.com/tag/%e0%b8%9e%e0%b8%b1%e0%b8%94%e0%b9%80%e0%b8%9b%e0%b8%a3%e0%b8%b5%e0%b8%a2%e0%b8%8d"}, {"title": "ผ้าบาติกสะสมในสมัย ร.5   หัตถศิลป์อันงดงามจากชวาสู่สยาม", "url": "https://www.thaipost.net/main/detail/55816"}, {"title": "www.thansettakij.com", "url": "https://www.thansettakij.com/blogs/columnist/517955"}, {"title": "King Chulalongkorn's Royal Cypher Medal", "url": "https://wawards.org/ru/thailand/king-chulalongkorn-s-royal-cypher-medal.html"}, {"title": "Chulalongkorn University Theses and Dissertations (Chula ETD)", "url": "https://digital.car.chula.ac.th/chulaetd/16577"}]}, "The search turned up one main source, Silpa Culture Magazine (silpa-mag.com), which covers this fan type.\n\n- **Type and style:** The fan is a \"phra phiti thamma\" (พัดพระพิธีธรรม) fan, a face-of-woman (พัดหน้านาง) design. Its description says it resembles the Pleuan fan of the Rama V period, and it comes in several colors.\n- **Colors:** The colors listed are yellow, red, blue, and green. พัดพระพิธีธรรม ในการสวดพระอภิธรรม เป็นพัดหน้านางสีเหลือง แดง น้ำเงิน และเขียว\n- **Construction:** The snippet describes both faces as silk, with gold-thread embroidery radiating from the center to the rim, and the edge trimmed with gold braid. The handle details were cut off in the snippet.\n- **Use:** The fan is used in chanting the Abhidhamma funeral rites, which the snippet names as the context.\n\nThe search did not return a second source confirming these details, and I did not find a dedicated page on the Rama V Pleuan fan itself. The snippets are also truncated, so the full article would be needed for the handle and any further historical detail."], "durationSeconds": 6.793951791, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01Ev2tLuy5whPtZunLHAmNF9", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
